    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Shauna O'Brien of BROE Auctioneers lettings is delighted to present this fabulous spacious three bedroom penthouse apartment in the ever popular development of New Bancroft Hall to the rental market. The modern accommodation which is bright and well laid out briefly comprises of the large entrance hall and a bright and spacious kitchen/living room with double doors onto a generous sized wraparound balcony spanning the entire apartment with east and south facing views over Dublin Mountains. Down the hallway to the Master bedroom with ensuite, the second and third bedrooms and the family bathroom. The location of the apartment is ideally situated in the heart of Tallaght minutes from the M50 and all local bus and Luas routes. This property has ease of access to any location in Dublin, appealing to any commuter. Within walking distance to the Tallaght shopping centre and all the amenities, it has to offer.\r\n\r\nContact Shauna O’Brien of BROE Auctioneers to register your interest today."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "•\tGas fired central heating\r\n•\tOpen plan living space\r\n•\tShow house condition. \r\n•\tDouble Glazed windows though out. \r\n•\tLarge warp around South facing balcony with views over the Wicklow Mountains.\r\n•\tDesignated parking. \r\n•\tSecure development. \r\n•\tNew development, Built in 2008."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: B3"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Viewing Details",
        "SortOrder": 6,
        "Content": "Contact Shauna O'Brien at BROE Auctioneers Lettings to arrange a viewing today.\r\n\r\nPlease note all appointments are strictly by appointment only.\r\n\r\nContact details, shauna@broe.ie or 01 459 4433"
      }
